# Fourth input graph — the FALSE branch of the third assertion
# (`not any(ontouml_graph.triples((text_shape_uri, ONTOUML.value, None)))`):
# view-1_shape is correctly typed ontouml:Text and carries no ontouml:text,
# but (simulating a decoder bug) carries a leftover ontouml:value triple ->
# the first two assertions pass, the third fails, demo() reports
# ("assertion-failed", ...).
@prefix ex:       <https://example.org#> .
@prefix ontouml:  <https://w3id.org/ontouml#> .
@prefix rdf:      <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

ex:view-1_shape rdf:type ontouml:Text ;
    ontouml:value "leaked legacy value" .
